    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;" color="#000000">
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; margin-top: 2px !important;">
    Modern church appeal
  </h2>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Modern church appeal"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>What’s happening?</strong> North Point Community Church's "The Living Room" (TLR) in Atlanta has achieved what many denominations struggle with: <a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/03/08/us/atlanta-north-point-church-gen-z" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">transforming Gen Z into fervent churchgoers</a>. The event resembles a concert, with live bands, dramatic lighting, and large crowds, but its aim is spiritual connection. The ministry has built a following of young people through relatable sermons, contemporary worship, and an emphasis on community.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>Challenges: </strong>Reaching Gen Z remains difficult for most churches. Surveys show younger Americans are less religious than previous generations and often wary of institutions they perceive as judgmental or outdated. Traditional congregations, particularly mainline Protestant churches, have seen membership decline sharply. Experts say attracting young worshippers requires consistent engagement, meaningful community, and addressing issues such as identity, relationships, and social anxiety.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5"><strong>Big picture:</strong> This move highlights a changing religious landscape in the US. While many denominations face shrinking congregations, some non-denominational megachurches are adapting by prioritizing small groups, mentorship, and outreach beyond church walls. Leaders say the approach focuses on practical faith and personal transformation rather than formal religious tradition.</p>
</mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
    <mj-spacer height="10px" />
    <mj-section
      background-color="#eff1f4"
      css-class="border-line"
      padding="1px 0.5px 1px 1px"
