              padding-bottom: 8px;
              color: #4d3060;
              text-align: left;
              border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;

              font-size: 26px;
              line-height: 1.2;
              font-weight: 400;
            "
          >
            Long story short
          </h2>
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text
  padding="14px 12px 0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 1px;
    "
  >
    Global Affairs
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Spain's government has launched a migrant amnesty scheme to legalize up to 500,000 undocumented residents.</strong> The scheme will grant a renewable one-year residency visa to eligible applicants who can prove at least 5 months of residence and no criminal record. The government says the move is both humanitarian and economic. However, critics warn it could encourage more irregular migration (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/crk8rdz5131o" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Spain’s migrant amnesty</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>A major fire engulfed a historic four-storey building near Glasgow Central railway station, causing a partial collapse and disrupting rail services.</strong> Around 18 fire appliances and specialist crews battled the blaze for hours, with thick smoke and flames visible across the area. No casualties were reported. Authorities urged the public to avoid the site as services at Scotland’s busiest station were suspended (<a href="https://edition.cnn.com/2026/03/08/europe/scotland-fire-glasgow-central-station-hnk-intl" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Glasgow blaze</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Business &amp; Markets
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>The US and Japan are exploring a partnership with Japan Display to build a $13B factory in the US as part of Tokyo's $550B investment package.</strong> Aimed at countering China's dominance in displays critical to military tech, the plan boosted Japan Display's share price by 80% amid its decade-long losses from OLED shifts and competition (<a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/news/us-japan-may-partner-japan-032154987.html" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">tech alliance</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Nintendo sued the US government seeking refunds on tariffs imposed via President Trump's IEEPA executive orders.</strong> The move follows a Supreme Court ruling that deemed the tariffs unlawful, despite the collection of over $200B in revenue from imports. Over 1,000 firms have filed similar claims. Trump hiked rates to 15% post-ruling, prompting suits from 24 states (<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/03/06/nintendo-sues-the-u-s-government-for-a-refund-on-tariffs/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Nintendo sues the US</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Global oil prices surged above $100 a barrel as escalating conflict involving Iran, Israel, and the US raised fears of prolonged disruption to shipments</strong> through the Strait of Hormuz. Analysts warn that continued disruption could drive oil prices toward $150. Markets reacted sharply, with stock indices falling across Asia and Europe and energy prices jumping (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c79542n0grwo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">Hormuz shock</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Science &amp; Tech
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-image
  border-radius="10px"
  padding="0px 12px 10px 12px"
  width="600px"
  src="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
  alt="Science &amp; Tech"
  href="https://www.presidentialsummary.com/"
/>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Tech reviewer Sonny Dickson leaked the purported CAD renders of Apple's rumoured foldable smartphone, the iPhone Fold. The book-style foldable device appears to feature a 7.8-inch inner display and a 5.3-inch cover screen, with hole-punch cameras on both displays. The design shows a dual rear camera setup in a pill-shaped module, a USB-C port, and side buttons similar to recent iPhone models. Reports indicate the phone could run on Apple’s upcoming A20 Pro chip, built on a 2nm process (<a href="https://www.gadgets360.com/mobiles/news/apple-iphone-fold-design-spotted-render-specifications-features-11188996" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">iPhone folds</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Scientists visualize how ketamine rewires key brain receptors to rapidly relieve treatment-resistant depression (TRD), using advanced PET brain scans.</strong> It triggers dynamic, region-specific AMPAR changes (increasing density in some cortical areas, reducing it in reward regions like the habenula) directly correlating with symptom relief in 34 TRD patients. This is the first direct evidence of ketamine’s antidepressant mechanism in humans (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/03/260307213234.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">depression treatment</a>).</p>
</mj-text>
<mj-divider
  border-width="1px"
  border-style="solid"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px"
/>
<mj-text
  padding="0px 12px"
  font-family="TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif;"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h3
    style="
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.2;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin-top: 15px;
    "
  >
    Whatnot
  </h3>
</mj-text>
<mj-text padding="0px 12px" font-family="Roboto+Serif" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Scientists say satellite imaging could transform how aging bridges are monitored worldwide (<a href="https://www.sciencedaily.com/releases/2026/03/260307213350.htm" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">aging alert</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Norwegian police investigate explosion at US embassy in Oslo as possible terrorism (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c5yjegg892lo" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">embassy blast</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">Princess Eugenie steps down as patron of anti-slavery charity (<a href="https://www.theguardian.com/news/2026/mar/08/princess-eugenie-daughter-of-prince-andrew-steps-down-as-patron-of-anti-slavery-charity" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">see why</a>).</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;
              line-height: 1.5;
              border-left: 3px solid #4d3060;
              padding-left: 14px;
              margin-bottom: 15px;">The Alps lost its vultures, and then it got them back (<a href="https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20260305-how-vultures-returned-from-alpine-extinction" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #4d3060;
                color: black;">wildlife comeback</a>).</p>
</mj-text>

